.type text xtcom
.continue ERROR  ? G|mandant <> "erp"
Transfer data to SQL-Database
.formula U|xtcom = "<(EDIConfiguration)>80001<(View)>,(MappingModel)? jobstart="
.command -WAIT 'U|xtcom'
Create BI-Cubes
.input "ow1/BI.CREATE.CUBES"
.continue

!ERROR
.box
Nur im ERP-Mandant m”glich
.continue





